Train **layout only** (no bot, monsters, trees, ores). Episode starts as L1 keep + core, infinite treasury. One model with two heads (action type + cell), L1 only. Ollama ok if score > 7; three consecutive failures reset to core. Protection = closed wall contour AND towers (open path or walls without towers = 0). Harvest penalty is radius overlap, not node coverage. Dashboard must show gym steps, PPO updates, and Ollama evals as three different counters. Do not start L2 or a second neural net. Full plan: `docs/TRAINING_REWORK_PLAN.md`.
